      generic: `Explain SQLite-first development: a file database with real constraints and migrations for local and single-process apps, the honest limits (one writer, no networked access, self-managed backups), and the low-drama path to hosted Postgres when the app multiplies - keeping SQL dialect-neutral the whole way.`,
