      "Postgres as a queue is legitimately underrated: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED is a worker claiming a job, with your existing database",
      "Backoff means the flaky third-party recovers alone: attempt delays 1m, 5m, 25m before a human sees a dead-letter page",
